; Describe a location with the "see" message
;
; Prints MsgSee ("<subject> see") followed by the location's description and
; picture through #R$964D. #R$8EEC calls it while it has temporarily put the
; same id into the first location slot of the subject's record.
; .
; A Location id
@label=DescribeSeen
c$962B LD HL,$B000   ;
 $962E JR $964D      ;
